{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multimodal, multiprofile setup using the scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion, comparing it to avgpool aggregation (config_037). Validation accuracy of 0.725 (vs. 0.706 in config_037) and F1 of 0.685 suggest transformer aggregation may improve performance, but the exact contribution of aggregation remains uncertain without direct comparison to other methods. The role of the image encoder or fusion strategy is not isolated in this comparison."
}

